  "description": "Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for ExcelMcp by Sbroenne. Enables AI assistants like GitHub Copilot, Claude, and ChatGPT to automate Excel workflows - Power Query M code, Power Pivot DAX measures, VBA macros, PivotTables, Excel Tables, ranges, formatting, data validation, and connections. 165 operations across 11 specialized tools. Uses Excel's native COM API for zero corruption risk. Windows x64 and ARM64 support.",
